{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tower Defense Game In Reverse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the attacker for once. Build your army and guide your Battering Ram along the path, through the maze of obstacles and fortifications to the enemy castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/9ecfd3bd575c9975a361a607d71a5002.poster.avif?t=1760815608\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/9ecfd3bd575c9975a361a607d71a5002.webm?t=1760815608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/9ecfd3bd575c9975a361a607d71a5002.mp4?t=1760815608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect the Ram at all costs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Battering Ram is your most important unit. Stay close and keep moving it forward. Guide it through the enemy castle and bring down every gate and obstacle in your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/ece9cca8f60be4e61fb6b8df03381c16.poster.avif?t=1760815608\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/ece9cca8f60be4e61fb6b8df03381c16.webm?t=1760815608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/ece9cca8f60be4e61fb6b8df03381c16.mp4?t=1760815608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Call the banners. Build your army. It's time for a siege.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your army with the rewards of your attacks. Choose from archers, swordsman and more to defend your Battering Ram and claim another castle for your Kingdom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the banner system to command your soldiers on the field of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/993cbcd60d3c02f304c555bd7388fd1c.poster.avif?t=1760815608\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/993cbcd60d3c02f304c555bd7388fd1c.webm?t=1760815608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/993cbcd60d3c02f304c555bd7388fd1c.mp4?t=1760815608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Army Dead? Step into action and become the King you were born to be.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your bow to pick off approaching enemies from a distance, swing your sword to take out groups of enemies in one fell swoop and set explosive traps for unsuspecting enemies to fall right into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/7b2fc8d22b792592c225c4e98991f869.poster.avif?t=1760815608\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/7b2fc8d22b792592c225c4e98991f869.webm?t=1760815608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/7b2fc8d22b792592c225c4e98991f869.mp4?t=1760815608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features and Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35+</strong> Levels across 8 unique worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+</strong> Enemy Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Attack mode (Bonus mode for every level)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible buildings and obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Score Tracking</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3021860?t=1760815608","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/43730d99e84cd459418244a1fc497b73ba322e37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760815608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/c89bd0be4fa946494751bbc31738d13a29a9e9bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760815608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/c89bd0be4fa946494751bbc31738d13a29a9e9bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760815608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tower Defense Game In Reverse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the attacker for once. Build your army and guide your Battering Ram along the path, through the maze of obstacles and fortifications to the enemy castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/9ecfd